    69	prompt_header() {
    70	cat <<PROMPT
    71	You are the cross-vendor reviewer on the 24h release hold (ADR-103) for
    72	the GA promotion of $RC_TAG to v1.3.0. Be adversarial and concrete.
    73	Your output is advisory evidence, not an authorization. The scope is
    74	SPLIT in 2 payloads (redactor cap); this is payload $1/2: $2.
